FirstMetShenyo: {
	ShenyoName: Shenyo
	L1: It has been a long time since anything living walked in here
	L2: How did you get here?
	OptDead: Died once. When I woke up, I was here
	OptRain: Snatched an umbrella and charged in
	OptDeadLocked: You have not died
	OptRainLocked: Your hands are empty
	A1: ...Back from the dead?
	A2: A rare thing. Though by the look of you, you seem used to it
	B1: Then your luck is not bad at all
	B2: Now it is time to leave
	C1: The umbrella will hold the way open for you. Go back
	C2: That umbrella is yours from now on
}

ShenyoDerivedUmbrella: {
	L1: That umbrella looks like a derived paranormal entity
	Opt1: A derived paranormal entity? Meaning it is a part of you?
	L2: Exactly. I once dismembered my own paranormal form, and the severed fragments revive on their own once enough years go by
	L3: This umbrella intruding on reality, for instance, is a paranormal phenomenon derived from the Kikasa's source
	Opt2: So you are not actually the source of the Kikasa?
	L4: I was, once
	L5: I should have died long ago, but my consciousness woke again inside a paranormal fragment left in this world
	L6: Touch this derived umbrella, and you should be able to enter its ghost domain
	L7: Whether you go is your own business
	L8: If you die in there, I will pull you back with a Restart
}

ShenyoDollGift: {
	L0: I just remembered something worth giving you
	L1: Keep this doll close. It can save your life once
	L2: The one who sewed these was a silly girl. She made a whole pile for someone she liked, though that person could never possibly need them
	L3: Back then I traded with her for quite a few. They make fine gifts for the young ones
}

ShenyoFesterSerpentGift: {
	L0: Things that fester in the sand look even worse than things that rot in water
	L1: That golden pus is not honey, one sniff up close and you will understand
	L2: Rinse the umbrella when you are done, dried pus stains never scrape off
}

ShenyoBossRushGift: {
	L0: Did they all come back, or did that old thing in the abyss wake?
	L1: Either way, this trip was no stroll
	L2: Stand steady. Do not sway in front of me
	L3: Once this meal is finished, the rain ought to stop
}

ShenyoCalamityEvilGift: {
	L0: Nest after nest, boring into blood and flesh. It hurts just to look
	L1: You, though, do not seem to mind the pain
	L2: Be more careful next time. This umbrella keeps off the rain, not those bugs
}

ShenyoCultistGift: {
	L0: Muttering on and on. Loud
	L1: That thing he meant to let out is nothing good
	L2: Good you cut him off, before the scene got out of hand
}

ShenyoDevourerOfGodsGift: {
	L0: That one circling the sky, they say it has swallowed gods
	L1: What a god tastes like, I am a little curious
	L2: Keep the shell if you like. You need not leave the meat for me
}

ShenyoDukeFishronGift: {
	L0: A pig learning to throw waves like a person. That is something
	L1: The temper of water is not its to wield
	L2: Good that you shoved it back under. Saves it from swaying under my eyes
}

ShenyoEmpressGift: {
	L0: Things this bright strain these eyes
	L1: No need to pick a fight with her in daylight. You, of course, go straight for the hard one
	L2: You rubbed the light dim. I will grant you that
}

ShenyoEvilBossGift: {
	L0Worm: One crawled out of the dirt, segment after segment. Disgusting
	L1Worm: The stink is heavier than rainwater... If you can stand it, fine
	L0Brain: A brain laid out in the open, and it does not even mind the cold
	L1Brain: Things like this, one look too many and they soil the eyes
	L2: Good that it is over. Do not come back soaked in that stink
}

ShenyoExoAndSCalGift: {
	L0: A craftsman's pride, a witch's obsession. Together they almost match
	L1: Both tables cleared. Today was not wasted
	L2: Days like this will not come around many more times
}

ShenyoEyeOfCthulhuGift: {
	L0: One eye open all night, looking everywhere, and not even afraid of scaring itself
	L1: Does not even blink. Makes the skin crawl
	L2: Closed now. Good. Out of sight, out of mind
}

ShenyoGolemGift: {
	L0: A stone head, and it still hops
	L1: Crack it open and it is nothing but an empty shell
	L2: That splash you earned yourself. I did not help
}

ShenyoKingSlimeGift: {
	L0: And this calls itself a king?
	L1: Soft all over, but it can bounce
	L2: When you meet something truly nasty, do not learn its bluster
}

ShenyoSeaShrimpGift: {
	L0: That shrimp under the beach, all crystal shell, one punch that knocks the water hollow
	L1: It sheds shell after shell, yet its temper never softens a bit
	L2: The hollow crack sounds scary, but you caught it, so your hands know their craft
}

ShenyoMechsGift: {
	L0: Chains, a light bulb, a skeleton. Together they look like a joke
	L1: The iron stink is heavy. I dislike it, you do not mind
	L2: All three cleaned up at once. I will grant you patience
}

ShenyoMoonLordGift: {
	L0: The one behind the moon. That at least has seen the world
	L1: Eyes all over, a little like the rain under this umbrella
	L2: The moonlight tonight is not bad at all
}

ShenyoOldDukeGift: {
	L0: That old thing, temper sourer than sour water
	L1: We have crossed paths a few times. Neither of us ever gave ground
	L2: This time you won
}

ShenyoPlanteraGift: {
	L0: A sleeping flower. Wake her and there will be trouble
	L1: The way those vines cling, a little like my umbrella when it will not close
	L2: If the sap stained your hands, wash them when you get back
}

ShenyoPolterghastGift: {
	L0: Those souls in the dungeon, stitched and restitched for centuries
	L1: They are poor souls that can actually be killed
	L2: Scattered is better than hanging there
}

ShenyoQueenBeeOrDeerclopsGift: {
	L0Bee: Sweet, yes, and the temper just as sharp. They match
	L1Bee: Honey is a good thing. Pity it will not share
	L0Deer: This one-eyed thing has a stubborn temper
	L1Deer: A single stick of wood, and all that noise
	L2: This trip, you are not hurt, are you?
}

ShenyoQueenSlimeGift: {
	L0: All pink and tender. It does know how to dress
	L1: Even brought an honor guard. Quite the show
	L2: Show or not, it will not last a rain
}

ShenyoSkeletronGift: {
	L0: Guarding that door for so many years, the bones ought to be soft by now
	L1: If it were me, I would have quit long ago
	L2: The dungeon door is open. Watch your step in there. Do not pick up its habit of sitting still until waiting becomes a vice
}

ShenyoSlimeGodGift: {
	L0: Purple and black stirred together, and it still dares to call itself a god
	L1: It has some skill, I will grant, mashing that much filth into one lump
	L2: Melted is better. Saves it from fouling the place
}

ShenyoWallOfFleshGift: {
	L0: That wall of flesh in hell, even through the umbrella I find it too hot
	L1: You punched through, and the world changed with it. This sort of thing, you do rather smoothly
	L2: Spectacle like this, there will be plenty more later
}

ShenyoYharonGift: {
	L0: A fire that has burned for so many years. It ought to go out
	L1: Fire and rain were never meant to get along
	L2: Once the feathers are wet, they will not float
}
